# Envelopes: INBOX and Sent of a Gmail account are fetched and threaded (a Sent reply joins the
# INBOX thread), a refetch updates flags, a failed fetch surfaces, and a UIDVALIDITY change drops
# the cached INBOX. Mailbox IDs come from line 6's seed: INBOX ..0006-0000-..0, Sent ..0006-0000-..1.
# Line 5's seed is 5 << 64, so the account's ID is 00000000-0000-0005-0000-000000000000.
